---
import LegalPage from '../../components/pages/LegalPage.astro'
import { site } from '../../data/site'
import { pathFor } from '../../i18n'
---

<LegalPage
  lang="en"
  page="terms"
  title="Terms of use"
  description="Terms of use for the GlowHaus Aesthetics Miami website: information, pricing, appointments and Cherry financing."
>
  <!--
  General template written for the website. The clinic should review it with its
  legal advisor before treating it as final.
  -->
  <p>
    These terms govern your use of the {site.name} website ("GlowHaus," "we," "us"). By using the
    site you agree to them. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Information, not medical advice</h2>
  <p>
    The content on this site is general and for informational purposes only. It is not a substitute
    for a medical assessment and does not create a provider-patient relationship. Before any
    treatment, a clinic provider will review your case in person and tell you whether it is right
    for you. In a medical emergency, call 911.
  </p>

  <h2>Pricing</h2>
  <p>
    Prices shown on the site are a guide, are in U.S. dollars and may change without notice. The
    final price, number of sessions and package terms are confirmed during your consultation, before
    treatment begins.
  </p>

  <h2>Results</h2>
  <p>
    Results vary from person to person and depend on factors such as skin type, age, health and
    aftercare. Before-and-after photos and testimonials show real cases but do not guarantee any
    specific outcome.
  </p>

  <h2>Appointments</h2>
  <p>
    Requesting an appointment through the form, WhatsApp or by phone does not automatically book it.
    Your appointment is confirmed only once the clinic confirms it with you. If you can't make it,
    please let us know as early as possible.
  </p>

  <h2>Cherry financing</h2>
  <p>
    Installment payments are offered through Cherry, an independent financing provider. Approval,
    terms, interest and conditions are decided by Cherry, not GlowHaus, and are subject to Cherry's
    review and its own terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>
    The site links to third-party services (WhatsApp, Google Maps, Instagram, Cherry). We don't
    control those services and are not responsible for their content or policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>
    The text, photos, videos, logos and design of this site belong to GlowHaus or its licensors. You
    may not copy, modify or use them commercially without our written permission. Third-party
    trademarks (such as Fotona, HydraFacial or Cherry) belong to their respective owners.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    We work to keep the information accurate and up to date, but the site is provided "as is." To
    the extent permitted by law, GlowHaus is not liable for damages arising from the use of, or
    inability to use, the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Florida and applicable U.S. federal law.
    Any dispute will be handled by the competent courts of Miami-Dade County, Florida.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms; the date above shows the latest version. For any questions, email us
    at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Please also see our{' '}
    <a href={pathFor('en', 'privacy')}>privacy policy</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
